<title>POLAND: IRENA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>IRENA FEB NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.61 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.85 vs   0.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.55 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Sales		    4.03 vs   4.20</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.20 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.73 vs   1.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.04 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Sales		    8.88 vs   7.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is Huta Szkla</p>
<p>Gospodarczego Irena SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
